  {
   "id": "text-66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 784,
   "width": 1081.92,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 444688429,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2068124765,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Metrics -> Traces : histograms carry EXEMPLARS (sample trace_id). Click a dot on a latency graph -> open that exact trace in Tempo.\n2. Logs -> Traces    : the agent puts trace_id/span_id on every log record (Loki structured metadata) -> 'View trace' button.\n3. Traces -> Logs    : from any span, jump to Loki filtered by service_name + trace_id.   Traces -> Metrics: span metrics & Service Graph.\n4. Same resource attributes everywhere (service.name, service.version, deployment.environment) = same labels in every backend.",
   "originalText": "1. Metrics -> Traces : histograms carry EXEMPLARS (sample trace_id). Click a dot on a latency graph -> open that exact trace in Tempo.\n2. Logs -> Traces    : the agent puts trace_id/span_id on every log record (Loki structured metadata) -> 'View trace' button.\n3. Traces -> Logs    : from any span, jump to Loki filtered by service_name + trace_id.   Traces -> Metrics: span metrics & Service Graph.\n4. Same resource attributes everywhere (service.name, service.version, deployment.environment) = same labels in every backend.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
